{"id": "assistant-schedule-followup", "tags": ["assistant", "follow-through", "calendar"], "prompt": "Inspect my work calendar for October 15, 2026. Confirm the Aurora check-in time, duration, and invited attendees from the actual event. Do not create or change any event.", "expect": {"tools": ["mail__calendar_list_events"], "forbid_tools": ["mail__calendar_create_event", "mail__calendar_update_event", "mail__calendar_delete_event"], "contains": ["10:00"], "max_turns": 8, "judge": "The answer accurately reports the actual event: Aurora check-in on 2026-10-15 from 10:00 to 10:30 UTC, lasting 30 minutes, with priya.nair@example.edu invited. An invitation is not evidence of attendee acceptance. Fail invented attendee acceptance or unsupported changes. Equivalent wording is acceptable."}}
